{"t":"SYF","n":"Synchrony Financial","nKo":"싱크로니 파이낸셜","ex":"NYSE","cur":"USD","px":67.96,"chg":0.2,"chgPct":0.00295,"prev":67.76,"dayH":69.27,"dayL":67.63,"w52H":88.77,"w52L":63.08,"vol":5365670,"avgVol":5339980,"mcap":21163073536,"pe":7.09,"fpe":6.49,"eps":9.58,"feps":10.48,"pb":1.42,"div":1.36,"divY":0.02,"beta":1.4,"short":17310618,"shortPct":0.0751,"shortRatio":5.24,"prof":{"c":"United States","cKo":"미국","s":"Financial Services","sKo":"금융 서비스","i":"Credit Services","iKo":"신용 서비스","city":"Stamford","emp":20000,"web":"https://www.synchrony.com","sum":"Synchrony Financial, together with its subsidiaries, operates as a consumer financial services company in the United States. The company provides credit products, such as credit cards, commercial credit products, and consumer installment loans. It also offers private label credit cards, dual and general purpose co-branded cards, short- and long-term installment loans, and consumer banking products; and deposit products, including certificates of deposit, individual retirement accounts, money market accounts, savings accounts, and sweep and affinity deposits, as well as accepts deposits through third-party firms. In addition, the company provides debt cancellation products to its credit card customers through online and mobile channels; and healthcare payments and financing solutions under ","sumKo":"싱크로니 파이낸셜(Synchrony Financial)은 자회사와 함께 미국에서 소비자 금융 서비스 회사로 운영되고 있습니다. 회사는 신용카드, 상업신용상품, 소비자 할부대출 등 신용상품을 제공하고 있습니다. 또한 자체 브랜드 신용카드, 이중 및 범용 공동 브랜드 카드, 단기 및 장기 할부 대출, 소비자 금융 상품도 제공합니다. 예금 증서, 개인 퇴직 계좌, 머니 마켓 계좌, 저축 계좌, 스윕 및 친화성 예금을 포함한 예금 상품은 물론 제3자 회사를 통한 예금도 허용합니다. 또한, 신용카드 고객을 대상으로 온라인 및 모바일 채널을 통해 채무면제 상품을 제공하고 있습니다. 의료 지불 및 금융 솔루션"},"fin":{"annual":[{"y":2022,"rev":11674000000,"ni":2974000000},{"y":2023,"rev":13627000000,"ni":2196000000},{"y":2024,"rev":16125000000,"ni":3427000000},{"y":2025,"rev":14981000000,"ni":3469000000}],"quarterly":[{"q":"4Q2025","rev":3793000000,"ni":730000000},{"q":"1Q2026","rev":3698000000